OL,3,GNEWSAFatal train crash could have been
OL,4,Aavoided if drain was built correctly -
OL,5,Asheriff
OL,6,
OL,7,FA train derailment which resulted in
OL,8,Fthe deaths of three men could have been
OL,9,Favoided if a drain had been built
OL,10,Fcorrectly, a sheriff has concluded.
OL,12,FDriver Brett McCullough, 45, conductor
OL,13,FDonald Dinnie, 58, and passenger
OL,14,FChristopher Stuchbury, 62, died in the
OL,15,Fcrash at Carmont, near Stonehaven in
OL,16,FAberdeenshire, in August 2020.
OL,18,FThe train derailed after hitting debris
OL,19,Fwhich had washed from the drain
OL,20,Ffollowing heavy rain.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
