OL,3,GNEWSAFatal train crash could have been
OL,4,Aavoided if drain was built correctly -
OL,5,Asheriff
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter a fatal accident inquiry (FAI),
OL,8,FSheriff Lesley Johnston said it was not
OL,9,Fconstructed and installed in accordance
OL,10,Fwith its design, and found there were
OL,11,Fprecautions which could have been taken
OL,12,Fwhich "might realistically have avoided
OL,13,Fthe accident".
